\description{
Compute standard errors and pointwise confidence intervals for variance
components of one score or fixed composite (in squared score units), or for
between-score covariance components (in score-product units), from an
\code{\link[=mfrm_g_study]{mfrm_g_study()}} object.

Quantify how estimated sources of score variation would vary across repeated
G-studies with the same assignment design. Supports balanced ANOVA and
identifiable MINQUE(0), including incomplete and supported nested sources.
